a for:\n  - Hibernate service resources.\n  - JBoss Logging provider discovery.\n  - Jackson class probes.\n  - `HSMessageLogger_$logger` construction.\n\nValidation with the requested GraalVM:\n\n- `checkMetadataFiles`: passed.\n- Full `test`, including native-image execution: passed, 1/1 tests successful.\n- The trace-enabled executable still reports a JUnit discovery failure and recursive `StackOverflowError`. This also occurred with an empty test and unrelated condition packages, demonstrating a GraalVM metadata-tracing/JUnit infrastructure issue rather than Hibernate Spatial behavior.\n- Running the same binary without runtime tracing exposed the complete missing-registration chain; after the fixes, it passes.\n\n`grund` and `fissile` checks could not run because those executables are unavailable in this environment.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c2acca4edb553c0016ab854c0755c87d2bfde7c433a45dc46\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 796, "output": 715, "cacheRead": 62976, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 493, "totalTokens": 64487, "cost": {"input": 0.0031839999999999998, "output": 0.014300000000000002, "cacheRead": 0.0251904, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0426744}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790465205143, "responseId": "resp_0c2acca4edb553c0016ab854b675a487d2a9454376ae6c10fa", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
